OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fand becoming increasingly cloudy
OL,7,Fthrough the evening, the best of any
OL,8,Fbreaks around the coast. A little
OL,9,Fdrizzle possible over the hills and
OL,10,Fwinds remaining light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FMainly dry. Cloudy to start
OL,13,Fbut occasional bright or sunny breaks
OL,14,Fdeveloping by day, the best of these
OL,15,Fin the west. Cloud returns in evening.
OL,16,FWinds will be moderate easterlies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
